Atic Atac -> Vector-06C
Port by Boris Likhachev, 2026.

Atic Atac (c) 1983 Ultimate Play the Game. This is a port of the Amstrad CPC 6128
version by John Ward (graphics Steven Day, sound Saul Cross):
https://github.com/shaymanjohn/aticatac-cpc
That repository has no licence; all rights to it belong to its authors. The game
logic of this port is translated from its Z80 source to Intel 8080 (src/model,
src/i8080); graphics, rooms, music, sound effects and the loading screen are
converted from it by the tools in tools/. The original sources are not included
here (ref/ is not part of the repository). This is a non-commercial fan port; it
will be taken down on request of the rights holders.

Third-party code:
- tools/vendor/Z80.js - Z80 emulator by Molly Howell, MIT License.
- src/vec/akg80.tpl - the Arkos Tracker 2 AKG player by Julien Nevo, MIT License,
  rewritten for Intel 8080.
